{"id":"7a897c755ea1e057","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error.md","title":"Fermat 检验的单边可靠性与条件概率界","display":"thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error — Fermat 检验的单边可靠性与条件概率界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error","aliases":["73-thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error"],"display":"thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error — Fermat 检验的单边可靠性与条件概率界","depends_on":["[[73-df-modular-multiplicative-order]]","[[73-thm-fermat-and-prime-generator]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.5.4, print pp. 517–518; PDF pp. 539–540; subgroup qualification made explicit","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error — Fermat 检验的单边可靠性与条件概率界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4307a2772edc1a3b\" href=\"?note=4307a2772edc1a3b\" title=\"73-df-modular-multiplicative-order\">73-df-modular-multiplicative-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc073a18f449598a\" href=\"?note=cc073a18f449598a\" title=\"73-thm-fermat-and-prime-generator\">73-thm-fermat-and-prime-generator</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.5.4, print pp. 517–518; PDF pp. 539–540; subgroup qualification made explicit"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\(a\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>；讨论抽样时使用该有限集上的均匀分布。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_n\">\\(F_n\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_n\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n-1\\}:\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,n-1)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_n\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n-1\\}:\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,n-1)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}(n)\\Longrightarrow|F_n|=n-1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,n-1)\\ne1\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Composite}(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Prime}(n)\\Longrightarrow|F_n|=n-1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,n-1)\\ne1\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Composite}(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\exists a\\in\\mathsf U_n\\;\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,n-1)\\ne1\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow |F_n|\\le\\tfrac12|\\mathsf U_n|\\le\\tfrac12(n-1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\exists a\\in\\mathsf U_n\\;\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,n-1)\\ne1\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow |F_n|\\le\\tfrac12|\\mathsf U_n|\\le\\tfrac12(n-1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>F_n 中的元素必为单位；它是单位群上的幂同态之核。若存在一个单位不在核中，核及其一个不同陪集等势且不相交，核至多占单位一半。必须要求有“单位见证”：仅存在一个非互素的失败底数不能推出一半概率界，Carmichael 数正好说明这个区别。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-modular-multiplicative-order","status":"resolved","id":"4307a2772edc1a3b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-modular-multiplicative-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-fermat-and-prime-generator","status":"resolved","id":"cc073a18f449598a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-fermat-and-prime-generator]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"F_n","display":false},{"tex":"F_n\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n-1\\}:\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,n-1)=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prime}(n)\\Longrightarrow|F_n|=n-1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,n-1)\\ne1\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Composite}(n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\exists a\\in\\mathsf U_n\\;\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,n-1)\\ne1\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow |F_n|\\le\\tfrac12|\\mathsf U_n|\\le\\tfrac12(n-1).","display":true}],"bytes":1703,"backlinks":[{"id":"ec11364efd189aca","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F_{561}$、$\\mathsf U_{561}$ 采用 [[73-thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error]]。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-312","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-fermat-test-one-sided-error|Fermat 检验的单边可靠性与条件概率界]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["4307a2772edc1a3b","cc073a18f449598a"]}